Week 6: Templates → Automation (needs Week 5)

Implemented. See the Week 6 entry in `.scaffold/sections/tasks/backlog.md` for
what was delivered, and the "Week 6" section of the README's notes on the
specification for where it departs from the plan above.

Summary: a document's regions can be saved as a template keyed to its vendor;
the processing job recognises that vendor on the next invoice by the text at
the top of the page and replays the saved rectangles onto it, snapping each to
the text actually underneath. Templates can also be applied by hand, to one
document or to a whole batch.
